{"seq":1,"slug":"sociological-theory","title":"社会学理论","stage":"DONE","category":"sociology","chapterCount":5,"docCount":22,"url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 社会学理论 简介\n\n社会学理论是理解人类社会运行逻辑的思想工具箱。从十九世纪工业革命催生的古典理论，到二十一世纪回应全球化与数字化的当代视角，社会学家们持续追问一个核心问题：社会秩序如何可能？个人与社会之间的张力如何塑造了我们的生活世界？本文档系统梳理社会学理论的主要流派与核心命题，帮助读者建立完整的理论认知框架。\n\n本系列适合对社会运行机制感兴趣的中高级知识工作者，尤其适合希望将社会学视角融入产品设计、技术决策或组织管理的程序员与技术管理者。你不需要社会学专业背景，但需要对\"人与社会\"这一命题保持好奇心和批判性思考的意愿。\n\n全书共分五章，沿着社会学理论的历史脉络与逻辑演进层层展开。\n\n第1章**古典社会学理论**从学科诞生讲起，依次呈现马克思、涂尔干、韦伯和齐美尔四位奠基人的核心思想。这些理论构成了后续所有流派的对话基础，理解它们是进入社会学理论世界的必要前提。\n\n第2章**现代社会学视角**介绍二十世纪中期以来的五大主流理论范式，包括结构功能主义、冲突理论、符号互动论、理性选择理论和社会建构主义。这些视角为分析当代社会提供了多元的分析工具。\n\n第3章**批判社会学**聚焦于对权力、文化与全球不平等的深层批判，涵盖法兰克福学派、布迪厄的文化资本理论、福柯的权力话语分析以及世界体系理论。\n\n第4章**女性主义社会学**系统呈现性别维度的社会学思考，从女性主义浪潮的历史演进到交叉性理论的当代发展，揭示性别如何作为一种基本的社会组织原则渗透在日常生活之中。\n\n第5章**后现代社会学**探讨现代性危机与社会学自身的理论转向，通过鲍德里亚、鲍曼和吉登斯等学者的思想，呈现社会学如何回应一个日益碎片化与流动化的世界。\n\n推荐的学习路径是按章节顺序阅读。古典理论为后续章节提供概念基础，现代视角展示理论的分化与竞争，批判社会学和女性主义社会学代表两条重要的反思路径，后现代社会学则将理论推向对自身前提的追问。如果你时间有限，建议优先阅读第1章和第2章，它们覆盖了社会学理论最核心的知识地图。对权力与不平等议题感兴趣的读者，可以将第3章和第4章作为重点深入。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-theory","title":"古典社会学理论","docCount":5,"url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/classical-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sociological-imagination","title":"社会学的想象力与学科起源","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/classical-theory/sociological-imagination"},{"seq":2,"slug":"marx-historical-materialism","title":"马克思与历史唯物主义","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/classical-theory/marx-historical-materialism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"durkheim-social-facts","title":"涂尔干与社会事实","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/classical-theory/durkheim-social-facts"},{"seq":4,"slug":"weber-rationalization","title":"韦伯与理性化理论","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/classical-theory/weber-rationalization"},{"seq":5,"slug":"simmel-social-forms","title":"齐美尔与社会形式","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/classical-theory/simmel-social-forms"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-perspectives","title":"现代社会学视角","docCount":5,"url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/modern-perspectives","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structural-functionalism","title":"结构功能主义","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/modern-perspectives/structural-functionalism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"conflict-theory","title":"冲突理论","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/modern-perspectives/conflict-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"symbolic-interactionism-theory","title":"符号互动论","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/modern-perspectives/symbolic-interactionism-theory"},{"seq":4,"slug":"rational-choice-exchange","title":"理性选择与社会交换理论","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/modern-perspectives/rational-choice-exchange"},{"seq":5,"slug":"social-constructionism","title":"社会建构主义","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/modern-perspectives/social-constructionism"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"critical-sociology","title":"批判社会学","docCount":4,"url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/critical-sociology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"frankfurt-school","title":"法兰克福学派与批判理论","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/critical-sociology/frankfurt-school"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bourdieu-cultural-capital","title":"布迪厄与文化资本理论","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/critical-sociology/bourdieu-cultural-capital"},{"seq":3,"slug":"foucault-power-discourse","title":"福柯与权力话语分析","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/critical-sociology/foucault-power-discourse"},{"seq":4,"slug":"world-systems-theory","title":"世界体系理论","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/critical-sociology/world-systems-theory"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"feminist-sociology","title":"女性主义社会学","docCount":4,"url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/feminist-sociology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feminist-waves-foundations","title":"女性主义浪潮与理论基础","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/feminist-sociology/feminist-waves-foundations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gender-social-construction","title":"性别的社会建构","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/feminist-sociology/gender-social-construction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"intersectionality","title":"交叉性理论","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/feminist-sociology/intersectionality"},{"seq":4,"slug":"care-work-reproduction","title":"照护劳动与社会再生产","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/feminist-sociology/care-work-reproduction"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"postmodern-sociology","title":"后现代社会学","docCount":4,"url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/postmodern-sociology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"postmodern-condition","title":"后现代状况与社会学转向","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/postmodern-sociology/postmodern-condition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"baudrillard-simulacra","title":"鲍德里亚与拟像理论","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/postmodern-sociology/baudrillard-simulacra"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bauman-liquid-modernity","title":"鲍曼与液态现代性","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/postmodern-sociology/bauman-liquid-modernity"},{"seq":4,"slug":"giddens-structuration","title":"吉登斯与结构化理论","url":"/h/sociology/sociological-theory/postmodern-sociology/giddens-structuration"}]}]}